ean water at a beach\" [ref=f15e427]'\n                    - 'button \"Open image gallery: Night sky over snowy mountains\" [ref=f15e428]'\n                  - generic [ref=f15e431]:\n                    - generic [ref=f15e434]:\n                      - button \"Copy\" [ref=f15e436] [cursor=pointer]\n                      - group \"Scrollable content\" [ref=f15e440]:\n                        - code [ref=f15e444]:\n                          - generic [ref=f15e445]: <ImageGallery>\n                          - generic [ref=f15e446]: <div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-3\">\n                          - generic [ref=f15e447]: <img src=\"/desert-road.jpg\" alt=\"Desert road\" title=\"Desert road\" />\n                          - generic [ref=f15e448]: <img src=\"/clear-water.jpg\" alt=\"Clear ocean water\" title=\"Clear ocean water\" />\n                          - generic [ref=f15e449]: <img src=\"/night-sky.jpg\" alt=\"Night sky\" title=\"Night sky\" />\n                          - generic [ref=f15e450]: </div>\n                          - generic [ref=f15e451]: </ImageGallery>\n                    - button \"View code\" [ref=f15e452]\n              - table [ref=f15e459]:\n                - rowgroup [ref=f15e460]:\n                  - row [ref=f15e461]:\n                    - columnheader [ref=f15e462]\n                  - row [ref=f15e466]:\n                    - cell \"buttonLabel\" [ref=f15e467]\n                    - cell [ref=f15e470]:\n                      - code [ref=f15e471]: string\n                    - cell \"Accessible label applied to enhanced image triggers.\" [ref=f15e472]\n                  - row [ref=f15e473]:\n                    - cell \"class\" [ref=f15e474]\n                    - cell [ref=f15e477]:\n                      - code [ref=f15e478]: string\n                    - cell \"Additional CSS classes merged onto the root element.\" [ref=f15e479]\n                  - row [ref=f15e480]:\n                    - cell \"closeLabel\" [ref=f15e481]\n      