ue, page scroll is locked while open.\" [ref=f15e529]\n                  - row [ref=f15e530]:\n                    - cell \"nextLabel\" [ref=f15e531]\n                    - cell [ref=f15e534]:\n                      - code [ref=f15e535]: string\n                    - cell \"Accessible label for next navigation.\" [ref=f15e536]\n                  - row [ref=f15e537]:\n                    - cell \"previousLabel\" [ref=f15e538]\n                    - cell [ref=f15e541]:\n                      - code [ref=f15e542]: string\n                    - cell \"Accessible label for previous navigation.\" [ref=f15e543]\n                  - row [ref=f15e544]:\n                    - cell \"theme\" [ref=f15e545]\n                    - cell [ref=f15e548]:\n                      - code [ref=f15e549]: ImageGalleryThemeProps\n                    - cell \"Per-instance theme overrides for image gallery parts.\" [ref=f15e550]\n                  - row [ref=f15e551]:\n                    - cell \"transitionDuration\" [ref=f15e552]\n                    - cell [ref=f15e555]:\n                      - code [ref=f15e556]: number\n                    - cell \"Zoom animation duration in milliseconds.\" [ref=f15e557]\n                  - row [ref=f15e558]:\n                    - cell \"zoomMargin\" [ref=f15e559]\n                    - cell [ref=f15e562]:\n                      - code [ref=f15e563]: number\n                    - cell \"Viewport margin, in pixels, kept around the zoomed gallery.\" [ref=f15e564]\n                - rowgroup [ref=f15e565]:\n                  - row [ref=f15e566]:\n                    - columnheader [ref=f15e567]\n                  - row [ref=f15e571]:\n                    - cell \"activeIndex\" [ref=f15e572]\n                    - cell [ref=f15e575]:\n                      - code [ref=f15e576]: number\n                    - cell \"Controls the active image index; bindable for two-way control.\" [ref=f15e577]\n                  - row [ref=f15e578]:\n                    - ce